/.task/
/tmp/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
*.pid

# Git publication exclusions. .chezmoiignore only controls installation;
# chezmoi's private_ filename prefix does not encrypt repository contents.
# Cover raw copies and chezmoi-encoded source paths. Templates stay trackable.

# Host environment, shell overrides, and machine profiles.
.env
.env.*
*dot_env
*dot_env.*
.zprofile*
*dot_zprofile*
.zshrc.local*
*dot_zshrc.local*
*machine.json
.config/chezmoi/
**/*dot_config/chezmoi/

# Authentication files and private key material.
.ssh/
**/*dot_ssh/
.git-credentials
*dot_git-credentials
.netrc
*dot_netrc
.pypirc
*dot_pypirc
.config/gh/
**/*dot_config/gh/
.aws/
**/*dot_aws/
*auth.json
*credentials.json
.codex/config.toml
**/*dot_codex/*config.toml
.claude/settings*.json
**/*dot_claude/*settings*.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Private recovery snapshots, old checkouts, and runtime databases.
snapshot/
snapshots/
backups/
legacy-source/
*.bundle
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tar.bz2
*.tar.xz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.7z
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-*
*.db
